370 PRINT "     1) YOU MUST SHOOT YOUR ARTILLERY SHELL OVER A HILL"
380 PRINT "     2) YOU MUST COMPENSATE FOR THE WIND"
390 PRINT "YOU MUST JUDGE THE ANGLE AND AMOUNT OF FORCE NECESSARY TO GET"
400 PRINT "YOUR SHELL OVER THE HILL AND INTO THE LAP OF YOUR OPPONENT."
410 PRINT "**** THIS GAME REQUIRES TWO HUMANS (OR SOME EQUIVALENT CARBON BASED"
420 PRINT "LIFE FORM) ****"
